	// The Boost bar under the Vehicle bar of the game's own HUD, while you ride a TGS bike. Its own type number:
	// the HUD draws every bar alike, but rebuilds map-script bars (TYPE_SERVER_VAR) from the map's list each
	// frame and drops health / vehicle / oxygen bars by its own rules — an unknown type it leaves to us.
	const BAR_TYPE_BOOST = 5;
