	// ================================================================================================
	// ---------- heavy vehicles: the tank, the hover tank, the jet ----------
	// ================================================================================================
	//
	// Each in two liveries after its concept sheet (the editor's Style ID: 1 or 2). They share the helicopter's
	// and the bike's machinery: our hull on the base vehicle's bodies, our model where the game draws it, our
