	// @@models

	// ---------- the Shadowstalker hover APC (hover tank, Style ID 1) ----------
	//
	// Traced off its concept sheet: the side view (facing left, 306 px of the sheet nose to tail) for its outline and
	// heights, the front and rear views for its width. SSK game px to a sheet px; the hull's middle at sheet
	// ( 386, 190 ). A central hull with a sloped glacis, bevelled sponsons down its sides carrying the TGS door
