	// ---------- the Scarlet Runner (jet, Style ID 3) ----------
	//
	// Traced off its concept sheet (side and front views at one scale: 861 sheet px nose to tail, 375 across its pods):
	// a light recon craft in gloss scarlet over a gunmetal frame. A keeled nose blade whose cheeks rise into horns
	// beside a low smoked canopy; an engine pod slung each side on a pylon (its intake in front, a white light bar at
	// its tail); long side strakes; a raised engine deck sweeping up into a spoiler, light fins under it; small nacelles
	// beside the engine block; landing skids that drop for a landing. No wings: it flies on antigravity (runnerDrive).
	// Sheet px ( sx, sy ) → model ( ( 496 - sx ) k, ( 150 - sy ) k ); across: front-view px from its middle × k. Drawn at
	// SR.s: its sheet's rider stands 60 px to its 215, the game's 80. x forward, y up.
	const SRK = 0.44;
